    "summary": "put() and putAll() don't update the getKeys() map",
    "description": "If you use the put() or putAll() methods of the ExtendedProperties class, it will not update the contents of the internal keysAsListed map which in turn will return a different list of keys using the getKeys() method than the keySet() method does.\n\nThe attached patchs fix this behaviour and add test cases."
